title: "Solution Preparation Calculator for Perovskite and Organic Solar Cells"
abstract: >-
  GUI calculator for solution-processed solar cells. Converts a perovskite
  ABX3 composition or an organic donor:acceptor blend ratio into precursor
  weighing masses and solvent volumes. Pure Python, no dependencies.
type: software
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-27
